+    network", the output-file sentence: h1 H21, h2 J03, J13 named PANDA and LIONESS-PUMA) or was read purpose_only
+    over a built fact (h2 J27's 600 or 6,000 genes, p4c/p5r C34's two deliverables, h1 H39, g4o2 C11). Phase 5c
+    already asks such a fact (two options named in the request) instead of clarifying the goal.
+    """
