+
+def _offered(task: str, span) -> bool:
+    """A1': the sentence naming the method names another registered one as its alternative ("Should I be using COBRA
+    or CONDOR", "Is SAMBAR the right thing to run, or one of the network methods like PANDA") -- a choice the user
+    asks about, never a goal (replay: A1 as declared ran both for p3 C10, p3/p5 C26)."""
